          {
            "typeName": "accessToSources",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "<b>Data files</b><br>\nRaw Data File_PSR_Total = A CSV file with the raw anonymized data of the study. Including all the questionnaire data (PSS, TAS20, and PID-5) and demographic information. Also, it contains the averaged physiological data of the participants that participated in the GO-Lab study. If items needed to be reversed, this has already been done and indicated with an _R at the end of the variable name.\n<br><br>\n<b>Supplemental material</b>\n<ul>\n<li>Checklist Lifestyle Rules</b> = Checklist we used to ensure participants obeyed the lifestyle rules before participation.<br>\n<li>Debriefing</b> = The debriefing form that we gave the participants after participation to sign.<br>\n<li>GO-Lab Protocol PSR_22082022</b> = The protocol for the GO-Lab study, with contact details removed.<br>\n<li>Information Letter</b> = The information letter for the participants\nInformed Consent Form_Part 1&Part2 = The informed consent forms for each of the two parts of the study.<br>\n<li>Lab questionnaire</b> = Emotion reactivity questionnaire booklet\nParticipants PSR= Logbook of participants in the GO-Lab with information about testleaders removed.<br>\n<li>Personality_and_Stress_Regulation_Qualtrics</b> = Questionnaire booklet from Qualtrics<br>\n<li>Protocol AcqKnowledge PSR_Students_2022</b> = Protocol for the processing of physiological data.\n</ul>\n<b>Structure data package</b><br>\nThe datafile includes the raw collected data, and the supplemental materials are about how the data was collected."
          }
        ]
